# ask_more_photos_prompt
# Source : Test the Ask More Photos flow on https://designtest.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/A | TC_ASKMOREPHOTOS_01
# Params : test_url test_mobile
# Map    : data/drafts/src_43c735155d39_TC_ASKMOREPHOTOS_01.map.json  (step -> source row, locator, selector, expected)

open ${test_url}
click ask_more_photos_cta
verify element mobile_number_input is visible
type "${test_mobile}" into mobile_number_input
click login_with_otp
verify element otp_input is visible
